  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4BwOAe.png\"><span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Vs9AVkxjYY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZEORx0F.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"75\"></a> </span> <span> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LrVLC2a.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"75\"></a></span></p>\n<p>此模組為使用者提供類似 NEI 的亮度覆蓋圖層。</p>\n<p>此模組需要 Rift、Forge 或 Fabric。 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config (Fabric)</a> 與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a>&nbsp;為 Fabric 必要前置模組，&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config (Forge)</a>&nbsp;與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury</a>&nbsp;則為 Forge 所需)</p>\n<p>Light Overlay 僅為客戶端模組，將其放置於伺服器上將無任何作用。</p>\n<p>按下&nbsp;<strong>F7</strong>&nbsp;即可切換亮度覆蓋圖層，設定可透過「控制設定」進行調整。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">一個 <span style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:36px\"><strong>黃色</strong></span> 十字代表怪物可在夜間生成，一個 <span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:36px\"><strong>紅色</strong></span> 十字代表怪物隨時皆可生成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">一個 <span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:36px\"><strong>藍色</strong></span> 十字代表若有生成器則怪物可生成（僅限 1.18）</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>設定：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">Rift 1.13.2：無法使用設定畫面</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">Forge 1.13.x：無法使用設定畫面</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">Forge 1.14+：模組列表 &gt;&nbsp;<strong>設定</strong></li>\n<li>Fabric 1.14+：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> &gt;&nbsp;<strong>設定</strong>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要伺服器與朋友一起遊玩？但不知道如何架設？直接租用已設定好的伺服器吧！</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fshedaniel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" alt=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" width=\"333\" height=\"108\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;點擊上方圖片，選擇方案（至少 4 GB），使用我的代碼&nbsp;<strong>shedaniel</strong>&nbsp;即可享有首月 25% 折扣，盡情與朋友同樂</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>截圖：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/523251999899385875/540546865100488746/unknown.png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/523251999899385875/673738838954475521/unknown.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/datg1nL.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>已知問題：</strong></p>\n<p>此模組與 OptiFine 陰影效果搭配時可能出現相容性問題：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/shedaniel/LightOverlay-Fabric/issues/5\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/shedaniel/LightOverlay-Fabric/issues/5</a>，不過您可以改用數字顯示模式，該模式可正常運作。</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<section>&lt;header class=&quot;h2  no-sub no-nav&quot;&gt;&lt;/header&gt;</section>\n</div>",
